Error [E1102]: this task returns a borrowed view, which can't cross into a task
  --> tests/ui/task_view_result.jet:6:28
    |
  6 |     t @= tasks.spawn(() => borrow_msg("hi"))
    |                            ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `view` results are borrowed, not owned; tasks and channels move owned values between threads
 Fix: give the task plain owned data, or remove the borrowed field before spawning
